event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": "\ud83e\udd16\n\nA", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 0, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " mechanical clock escapement is the mechanism that sits between the power source and the timekeeping oscillator, and it performs two inseparable jobs at", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 1, "final": false}

event: session.terminal.activity
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "session.terminal.activity", "session_id": "ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "terminal_id": "terminal_cursor_main"}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " once: it meters the release of stored energy into equal, countable steps, and it delivers a small kick to the", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 2, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " oscillator on every cycle so the oscillator keeps moving against friction. Without it, a wound mains", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 3, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": "pring or a lifted weight would simply spin the gear train free in a second or two; with it, that same energy is doled out one", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 4, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " tooth at a time, and each tooth becomes an audible tick. The name itself captures the idea \u2014", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 5, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " energy \"escapes\" in controlled increments rather than all at once. Every escap", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 6, "final": false}

event: session.terminal.activity
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "session.terminal.activity", "session_id": "ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "terminal_id": "terminal_cursor_main"}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": "ement is therefore a feedback loop: the oscillator gates the energy, and the energy sustains the oscillator.\n\nThe", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 7, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " classic layout begins with the power source \u2014 a coiled mainspring in a watch,", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 8, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " or a hanging weight in a longcase clock \u2014 which applies a steady torque to a train of gears. The train steps the speed down", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 9, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " and the torque up through several wheels, ending at the escape wheel, a specially cut gear", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 10, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " whose teeth are the actual \"valve\" of the system. Sitting across the escape wheel is a", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 11, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " pair of pallets (often two jeweled stones on a fork-shaped lever)", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 12, "final": false}

event: session.terminal.activity
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "session.terminal.activity", "session_id": "ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "terminal_id": "terminal_cursor_main"}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " that alternately block and release the teeth. Beyond the pallets is the oscillator \u2014 a pendulum in clocks, or a balance wheel with a hairspring in watches \u2014 whose natural period is what the clock actually", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 13, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " counts. A crutch or fork links the oscillator's swing to the pallet lever so that the oscillator's motion directly lifts and drops the pallets.\n\nThe", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 14, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " cycle runs as follows. One pallet is locked against a tooth, holding the", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 15, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " wheel still while the gear train strains", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 16, "final": false}

event: session.terminal.activity
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "session.terminal.activity", "session_id": "ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "terminal_id": "terminal_cursor_main"}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " against it. As the oscillator swings, it lifts that pallet just enough to let the tooth slip past", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 17, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": "; the wheel, driven by the train, advances by one tooth. The tooth's face and the pallet", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 18, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": "'s impulse face are angled so that, as the tooth slides off, it pushes the pallet in the direction the oscillator is already moving \u2014", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 19, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " this is the impulse, the tiny energy transfer that re-energizes the swing. A heartbeat", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 20, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " later the second pallet drops into the path of the next tooth and locks the wheel again, until the oscillator swings back the other way and the whole", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 21, "final": false}

event: session.terminal.activity
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "session.terminal.activity", "session_id": "ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "terminal_id": "terminal_cursor_main"}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " exchange repeats on the opposite side. One", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 22, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " full oscillation thus yields two advances \u2014 the familiar tick and tock.\n\nThe geometry", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 23, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " of those faces is where the real engineering lives, because the escapement must release and", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 24, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " impulse the wheel while disturbing the oscillator's natural period as little as possible. The \"lock\" faces are", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 25, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " cut with a slight draw so that, when a pallet settles against a tooth, the wheel", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 26, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": "'s own torque nudges the pallet slightly deeper into engagement rather than letting it rattle free", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 27, "final": false}

event: session.terminal.activity
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "session.terminal.activity", "session_id": "ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "terminal_id": "terminal_cursor_main"}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": ". The \"drop\" \u2014 the brief instant when neither pallet touches a tooth and the wheel runs unchecked \u2014 is kept as short as possible,", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 28, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " because during the drop the oscillator is uncontrolled and the timing is at the mercy of the torque", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 29, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": ". The \"lift\" is the angular travel during which the impulse is delivered, and it must be large enough to sustain the swing", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 30, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " yet small enough not to overdrive it. Designers trade these angles against each other to", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 31, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " minimize what horologists call the escapement error: the small dependence of the rate on how hard the spring is wound.\n\nDifferent", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 32, "final": false}

event: session.terminal.activity
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "session.terminal.activity", "session_id": "ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "terminal_id": "terminal_cursor_main"}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " escapements embody different compromises of this geometry. The verge and foliot, the earliest, lets the crown wheel recoil", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 33, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " slightly backward at the end of each beat, which makes the hands visibly shudder but is forgiving to", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 34, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " build. The dead-beat (Graham) escapement, perfected for pendulum clocks, is designed so the locking", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 35, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " faces are concentric with the pallet axis: after the impulse the wheel simply stops dead rather", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 36, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " than recoiling, which removes a source of error and lets the second hand land cleanly on each mark", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 37, "final": false}

event: session.terminal.activity
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "session.terminal.activity", "session_id": "ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "terminal_id": "terminal_cursor_main"}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": ". The lever escapement, dominant in watches, isolates the balance wheel from the gear train except during the brief", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 38, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " impulse and unlock, so the oscillator is nearly free for most of its arc \u2014 a property called \"", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 39, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": "detachment\" that is the key to good watch timekeeping. Each is a different answer to the same question", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 40, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": ": how do you let energy out and push the oscillator while touching it as little as possible?\n\nUltimately", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 41, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " the clock's accuracy rests on the oscillator, not the", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 42, "final": false}

event: session.terminal.activity
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "session.terminal.activity", "session_id": "ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "terminal_id": "terminal_cursor_main"}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " escapement: a pendulum's period depends almost entirely on its length and on gravity (and is nearly", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 43, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " independent of amplitude at small angles, the property called isochronism), while a balance wheel's period depends on its moment of inertia and the hairs", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 44, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": "pring's stiffness. The escapement's task is to be a faithful servant \u2014 to count the oscillator", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 45, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": "'s beats by releasing one tooth per beat, to feed back just enough energy to replace what", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 46, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " friction takes, and to add as little of its own timing disturbance as the craft allows. When", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 47, "final": false}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": " all of this is in balance, the stored energy of a spring or a weight is transm", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 48, "final": false}

event: session.terminal.activity
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "session.terminal.activity", "session_id": "ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "terminal_id": "terminal_cursor_main"}

event: response.output_text.delta
data: {"sequence_number": null, "type": "response.output_text.delta", "delta": "uted, tick by tick, into the steady, audible measurement of time.\n\nCLOCK", "message_id": "cursor-live-ac4d200b325345348041c840b492257c", "index": 49, "final": false}

